# Blender 3D (this project)

For any 3D / Blender / modeling / construction-scene request:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/3d-building-blender/SKILL.md`
2. Start with `.cursor/skills/blender-director/SKILL.md` for pipeline routing
3. Drive Blender through MCP tools — never give click-by-click UI tutorials
4. After mesh or lighting changes, take a viewport screenshot before claiming done
5. Working file is `projects/workshop/workshop.blend`; per-building files under `projects/`; animation contract is `animate_construction.py`
6. Web viewer lives in `stage/` — export glTF there, do not rebuild the building in Three.js unless asked
